# gui/.xcode-version -- the Xcode whose build-setting presets are baked into
# the tracked project.pbxproj.
#
# WHY THIS EXISTS, MEASURED 2026-08-13.
# gui/.xcodegen-version pins the GENERATOR. It does not pin the generator's
# other input. xcodegen injects default build settings (settingPresets) that
# it reads from the INSTALLED XCODE, so the same xcodegen 2.44.1 emits
# different bytes on different Xcodes from an identical project.yml:
#
#   build host  Xcode 26.6 (17F113)  emits COMBINE_HIDPI_IMAGES,
#                                    LD_RUNPATH_SEARCH_PATHS, SDKROOT,
#                                    ASSETCATALOG_COMPILER_APPICON_NAME
#   macos-14    Xcode 15.4 (15F31d)  omits all four
#
# The tracked pbxproj carries the first set, so a byte-exact comparison on a
# hosted runner reported STALE for a toolchain difference -- the exact
# 'gate goes red for the wrong reason' failure the version pin was added to
# prevent, reappearing one layer down.
#
# A mismatch here is UNAVAILABLE (exit 2), never STALE (exit 1).
26.6
